#: ../../developer-api/rate-limits.md:1 f8a25bb87ca94aec818d9ddc5b0b100b
msgid "Rate limits"
msgstr "速率限制"

#: ../../developer-api/rate-limits.md:3 c0e245c104b54395ac9aa706ffbbdc63
msgid "Limits are enforced **per key**, per minute:"
msgstr "限制以**每个密钥**为单位，按每分钟执行："

#: ../../developer-api/rate-limits.md fe342ef176f04d93ab4222b1fb1724a9
msgid "Tier"
msgstr "订阅层级"

#: ../../developer-api/rate-limits.md c46d3f3537724417bc79737586f5338f
msgid "Requests / minute"
msgstr "请求数/分钟"

#: ../../developer-api/rate-limits.md 7aba0555ccd44a439bad37fa23b7d5d7
msgid "Starter"
msgstr "Starter"

#: ../../developer-api/rate-limits.md 24c045192ce0491dbf800f6bb0c8d195
msgid "120"
msgstr "120"

#: ../../developer-api/rate-limits.md 9d9925928afa43c68f1ca7a3b4ecfe2b
msgid "Pro / higher"
msgstr "Pro 及以上"

#: ../../developer-api/rate-limits.md 498e2e208aff42fea741aadb2bcb490d
msgid "600"
msgstr "600"

#: ../../developer-api/rate-limits.md:10 23805b2f0f0f4ae595d0d24d61d3dca1
msgid ""
"Image uploads have a tighter dedicated budget (15/min) and a tier-scaled "
"daily quota on top of the per-minute limit."
msgstr "图片上传拥有更严格的专用限额（15 次/分钟），并在按分钟限制之上叠加了按订阅层级调整的每日配额。"

#: ../../developer-api/rate-limits.md:12 8be4d41e6e2149299385260ddb713180
msgid "Headers"
msgstr "请求头"

#: ../../developer-api/rate-limits.md:14 0df107e65d7f4aa783b5f75c32657cfa
msgid ""
"**Every** response carries rate-limit headers — not just `429`s — so a "
"client can pace itself without waiting to be rejected:"
msgstr "**每一个**响应都携带速率限制相关的请求头——而不仅仅是 `429` 响应——因此客户端无需等到被拒绝才能自我调节请求节奏："

#: ../../developer-api/rate-limits.md 6f87a4ebece64fbaafd6d3dcd8552799
msgid "Header"
msgstr "请求头"

#: ../../developer-api/rate-limits.md 5959436a025942eea4f2a0b1cc1c2717
msgid "Meaning"
msgstr "含义"

#: ../../developer-api/rate-limits.md a9f0899e49fd4f879b373b06ee91cff2
msgid "`X-RateLimit-Limit`"
msgstr "`X-RateLimit-Limit`"

#: ../../developer-api/rate-limits.md acd39c80cfce4ed88e7bfc6fa12cbfa6
msgid "Your per-minute ceiling."
msgstr "你每分钟的请求上限。"

#: ../../developer-api/rate-limits.md ff4583b776504ba08a87bf69993cc1b2
msgid "`X-RateLimit-Remaining`"
msgstr "`X-RateLimit-Remaining`"

#: ../../developer-api/rate-limits.md 063247e9891c4f438efbc469ee4d8fed
msgid "Requests left in the current window."
msgstr "当前时间窗口内剩余的请求数。"

#: ../../developer-api/rate-limits.md 19195f7e16d347b9a90101644a1011a1
msgid "`X-RateLimit-Reset`"
msgstr "`X-RateLimit-Reset`"

#: ../../developer-api/rate-limits.md 71b19346265048f78d14d06617975c44
msgid "Unix time (seconds) when the window resets."
msgstr "时间窗口重置的 Unix 时间（秒）。"

#: ../../developer-api/rate-limits.md:22 845a9f57ca284889ad7ec33cecb4f0ef
msgid ""
"A `429 Too Many Requests` also includes `Retry-After` (seconds). Back off"
" and retry after that delay rather than retrying immediately — a tight "
"retry loop burns the next window too."
msgstr ""
"`429 Too Many Requests` 响应还会包含 `Retry-"
"After`（秒）。请在该延迟之后再重试，而不要立即重试——过于密集的重试循环会连下一个时间窗口的配额也一并耗尽。"

#: ../../developer-api/rate-limits.md:25 a504b16e15e84a59a53da04c2ba71585
msgid ""
"Reading `X-RateLimit-Remaining` and slowing down as it approaches zero "
"keeps a batch job under the limit without ever taking a `429`."
msgstr "读取 `X-RateLimit-Remaining` 并在其接近零时主动放慢速度，可以让批处理任务始终保持在限制之内，而不会触发 `429`。"

